      "title": "Gillette India Limited Announces Resignation of Independent Director C P Gurnani, Effective January 6, 2026",
      "body": "Gillette India Limited announced that Mr. C P Gurnani has tendered his resignation as an Independent Director of the Company effective January 6, 2026, due to personal reasons and his increasing professional commitments. Mr. C P Gurnani held directorships in Mahindra Holidays & Resorts India Limited, where he was involved in several committees including Stakeholders Relationship Committee (Chairperson), Risk Management Committee (Member), Corporate Social Responsibility Committee (Member), and Inventory Approval Committee (Chairperson). Mr. C P Gurnani has confirmed that there are no material reasons for his resignation other than those mentioned in his resignation letter.",
